• Can the product be fully disassembled with a standard set of hand tools?
• How many distinct fastener types does the product require, and can this number be reduced?
• Is the disassembly sequence intuitive or does it require specialised knowledge?
• Are all disassembly points visible and accessible without removing unrelated components?
• What is the estimated manual disassembly time, and how does it compare to the material recovery value?